-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ה/10 (12.6.2025): גמול ההכנה לבחינת הבגרות בחטיבה העליונה
-- The matriculation-preparation reward in the upper division: what each
-- kind of assessment is, in which year each part of the reward is given,
-- how the size of the class scales it, and the tables that split each
-- subject's reward between the external exam, the school's alternative
-- assessment and (in the flexible matriculation programme) the controlled
-- performance tasks, with the academisation programme's split.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- THE TABLES. The corpus publishes this circular's tables as loose lines of
-- text, a printed row broken over several lines with its cells in reverse
-- order (and one stretch, the three one-unit subjects of the flexible
-- programme, as a table). The values below are the values those lines
-- print; which column each belongs to was read off the columns of the
-- printed page. A corpus defect, not a finding.

§ `תשפ"ה/10 גמול ההכנה לבחינת הבגרות`

-- akn:hc_1/p1 akn:hc_1/p2 akn:hc_1/p3 akn:hc_1/p4 akn:hc_1/p5 akn:hc_1/p6 akn:hc_1/p7 akn:hc_1/p8 akn:hc_1/p9 akn:hc_1/p10 akn:hc_1/p11 akn:hc_1/p12 akn:hc_1/p13 The letterhead, date (12.6.2025), reference number, circular number, addressee (the owners of upper divisions), greeting and subject line; no rule.

-- akn:hc_1/p14 akn:hc_1/p15 The circular's purpose: it consolidates circulars תשע"ה/2, תשע"ט/9, תש"פ/2 and תשפ"ג/10, adds the updates of the agreement of 23.9.2024, and carries the tables below; no rule of its own.

-- akn:hc_1/p16 akn:hc_1/p17 akn:hc_1/p18 akn:hc_1/p19 akn:hc_1/p20 akn:hc_1/p21 akn:hc_1/p22 akn:hc_1/p23 akn:hc_1/p24 akn:hc_1/p25 akn:hc_1/p26 akn:hc_1/p27 akn:hc_1/p28 akn:hc_1/p29 akn:hc_1/p30 akn:hc_1/p31 akn:hc_1/p32 akn:hc_1/p33 akn:hc_1/p34 akn:hc_1/p35 akn:hc_1/p36 akn:hc_1/p37 akn:hc_1/p38 akn:hc_1/p39 akn:hc_1/p40 akn:hc_1/p41 The sign-off of the covering letter, the list of copies and a page number; no rule.

-- akn:hc_1/p42 akn:hc_1/p43 akn:hc_1/p44 akn:hc_1/p45 akn:hc_1/p46 akn:hc_1/p47 akn:hc_1/p48 The table of contents; no rule.

§§ `הגדרות`

DECLARE `kind of assessment` IS ONE OF
    `external matriculation exam`
    `school alternative assessment`
    `internal assessment`
    `controlled performance tasks`

DECLARE `grade report` IS ONE OF
    `report the alternative grade to the exams department` HAS `school year of the report` IS A NUMBER

-- p49-p52: the external exam is the government exam set by the Ministry's
-- exams department and marked by its examiners, usually 70% of the
-- material. Under the corona outline (while it lasts) a school assessment
-- in the humanities that the exams department so designates counts as
-- external.
@ref akn:hc_1/p49 akn:hc_1/p50 akn:hc_1/p51 akn:hc_1/p52
GIVEN k IS A `kind of assessment`, `designated as external under the corona outline` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `counts as an external exam` k `designated as external under the corona outline` IF
        k EQUALS `external matriculation exam`
    OR (k EQUALS `school alternative assessment` AND `designated as external under the corona outline`)

-- p53-p55: the alternative (school) assessment is the school's own, in the
-- way it chooses, usually 30% of the material, and is held only in a
-- subject that also has an external exam.
@ref akn:hc_1/p53 akn:hc_1/p54 akn:hc_1/p55
GIVEN `the subject has an external exam` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an alternative assessment may be held` `the subject has an external exam` IF
    `the subject has an external exam`

-- p56-p58: in a school whose annual grades are not recognised
-- (director-general circular, siduri 459) the alternative assessment is
-- done by an external exam of the exams department.
@ref akn:hc_1/p56 akn:hc_1/p57 akn:hc_1/p58
GIVEN `the school's annual grades are recognised` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the alternative assessment is an exams-department exam` `the school's annual grades are recognised` IF
    NOT `the school's annual grades are recognised`

-- p59: by the exams department's instructions the alternative assessment's
-- grade is reported to the exams department in the year the assessment is
-- held. "יש לדווח" is addressed, like the whole circular, to the owning
-- bodies. The year is the time limit the text states, so there is no
-- WITHIN.
@ref akn:hc_1/p59
GIVEN `year the assessment is held` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `grade report`
DECIDE `the alternative grade is reported in its year` `year the assessment is held` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `report the alternative grade to the exams department` y
          PROVIDED y EQUALS `year the assessment is held`

-- akn:hc_1/p60 akn:hc_1/p61 The final grade, which weighs the external exam and the alternative assessment, appears on the certificate by the rules of director-general circular siduri 307 (linked); a pointer to rules set there, no rule of this circular.

-- p62-p65: an internal assessment is the school's grade in a subject with
-- no external exam; it appears separately on the certificate and does not
-- entitle the teacher to the preparation reward.
@ref akn:hc_1/p62 akn:hc_1/p63 akn:hc_1/p64 akn:hc_1/p65
GIVEN k IS A `kind of assessment`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `does not entitle the teacher to the preparation reward` k IF
    k EQUALS `internal assessment`

§§ `הוראות כלליות`

-- א-ב, and the flexible programme's א-ג: each part of the reward is given
-- in the school year in which the class sits that part — the external
-- exam, the alternative assessment, the controlled performance tasks.
@ref akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_a akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_b akn:hc_1__hc_2__para_a akn:hc_1__hc_2__para_b
GIVEN `year the class sits the part` IS A NUMBER, `school year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the part's reward is given in` `year the class sits the part` `school year` IF
    `school year` EQUALS `year the class sits the part`

-- The flexible programme's ג: where each controlled task is submitted in a
-- different school year, the tasks' reward is divided between those years.
-- The text says "divide" and names no key; each year takes the share of
-- the tasks submitted in it, which with two tasks is half each.
@ref akn:hc_1__hc_2__para_c
GIVEN `tasks' reward` IS A NUMBER, `tasks submitted this year` IS A NUMBER, `tasks in all` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the tasks' reward given this year` `tasks' reward` `tasks submitted this year` `tasks in all` IS
    `tasks' reward` TIMES `tasks submitted this year` DIVIDED BY `tasks in all`

-- ג (and the flexible programme's ד): the table's reward is for a class of
-- ten pupils or more; a class of 6-9 receives 50% of it and one of 1-5 25%.
@ref akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p1 akn:hc_1__hc_2__para_d/p1
GIVEN pupils IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the class-size share` pupils IS
    BRANCH IF pupils AT LEAST 10 THEN 1
           IF pupils AT LEAST 6  THEN 50%
           IF pupils AT LEAST 1  THEN 25%
           OTHERWISE 0

GIVEN `table reward` IS A NUMBER, pupils IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the reward for the class` `table reward` pupils IS
    `table reward` TIMES `the class-size share` pupils

§§ `טבלאות גמול הבגרות`

@desc One printed row of the reward tables: a subject, its units and questionnaire, and the reward in weekly hours and in percent for the external exam, the alternative assessment and in total. A cell the page leaves empty is 0.
DECLARE `reward row` HAS
    `subject`               IS A STRING
    `units`                 IS A NUMBER
    `questionnaire`         IS A STRING
    `external hours`        IS A NUMBER
    `external percent`      IS A NUMBER
    `alternative hours`     IS A NUMBER
    `alternative percent`   IS A NUMBER
    `total hours`           IS A NUMBER
    `total percent`         IS A NUMBER

GIVEN r IS A `reward row`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the row adds up` r IF
        r's `external hours` PLUS r's `alternative hours` EQUALS r's `total hours`
    AND r's `external percent` PLUS r's `alternative percent` EQUALS r's `total percent`

-- akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p2 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p3 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p4 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p5 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p6 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p7 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p8 The heading "compulsory subjects" and the table's column headings: subject, units, total, external exam (70%), alternative assessment (30%), each in weekly hours and percent, and notes.

-- Mathematics, by questionnaire. In 3 units the alternative assessment is
-- questionnaire 35183 (035183); in a school without recognition,
-- questionnaires 35182, 035173, 35172. 5 units also counts questionnaire
-- 035552 with 035582.
@ref akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p9 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p10 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p11 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p12 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p13 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p14 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p15 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p16 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p17 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p18 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p19 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p20 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p21 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p22 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p23 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p24 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p25 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p26
`the mathematics rows` MEANS
    LIST `reward row` "mathematics" 3 "035183 035173" 0    0   0.5 (2%)  0.5  (2%),
         `reward row` "mathematics" 3 "035381 035371" 0.5  (2%)  0   0   0.5  (2%),
         `reward row` "mathematics" 3 "035382 035372" 1    (2%)  0   0   1    (2%),
         `reward row` "mathematics" 4 "035481 035471" 2    (4%)  0   0   2    (4%),
         `reward row` "mathematics" 4 "035482 035472" 1    (2%)  0   0   1    (2%),
         `reward row` "mathematics" 5 "035581 035571" 2.25 (4%)  0   0   2.25 (4%),
         `reward row` "mathematics" 5 "035582 035572" 1.25 (2%)  0   0   1.25 (2%)

-- akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p27 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p28 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p29 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p30 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p31 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p32 The column headings repeated at the top of the next page.

-- English, by questionnaire. The alternative assessment is B 016383 (3
-- units), D 016483 (4) and F 016583 (5); in a school without recognition
-- 016384, 016484 and 016584. The oral exam (016387/016385, 016486/016485,
-- 016586/016585) prints only 2% in the external-percent column, "from
-- 1.9.2024", and no total.
@ref akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p33 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p34 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p35 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p36 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p37 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p38 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p39 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p40 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p41 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p42 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p43 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p44 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p45 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p46 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p47 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p48 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p49 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p50 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p51 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p52 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p53 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p54 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p55 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p56 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p57 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p58 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p59
`the English rows` MEANS
    LIST `reward row` "English" 3 "A 016381"           0.5  (2%) 0    0  0.5  (2%),
         `reward row` "English" 3 "B 016383"           0    0  0.5  (2%) 0.5  (2%),
         `reward row` "English" 3 "C 016382"           1    (2%) 0    0  1    (2%),
         `reward row` "English" 3 "oral 016387/016385" 0    (2%) 0    0  0    0,
         `reward row` "English" 4 "C 016382"           1    (2%) 0    0  1    (2%),
         `reward row` "English" 4 "D 016483"           0    0  1    (2%) 1    (2%),
         `reward row` "English" 4 "E 016471"           1    (2%) 0    0  1    (2%),
         `reward row` "English" 4 "oral 016486/016485" 0    (2%) 0    0  0    0,
         `reward row` "English" 5 "E 016471"           1    (2%) 0    0  1    (2%),
         `reward row` "English" 5 "F 016583"           0    0  1.25 (2%) 1.25 (2%),
         `reward row` "English" 5 "G 016582"           1.25 (2%) 0    0  1.25 (2%),
         `reward row` "English" 5 "oral 016586/016585" 0    (2%) 0    0  0    0

GIVEN q IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is an oral exam` q IF
    q EQUALS "oral 016387/016385" OR q EQUALS "oral 016486/016485" OR q EQUALS "oral 016586/016585"

-- The oral exam's reward runs from 1.9.2024.
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the English oral reward applies on` d IF
    DATE_SERIAL d AT LEAST DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2024)

-- The table's note: in mathematics of 4 and 5 units the exams are external
-- only, with no alternative assessment.
@ref akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p60
GIVEN units IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `mathematics has an alternative assessment at` units IF
    units LESS THAN 4

-- akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p61 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p62 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p63 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p64 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p65 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p66 The column headings repeated at the top of the next page.

-- The other compulsory subjects. Notes: religious Bible and Oral Torah
-- have two external questionnaires, and Haredi Judaism and Haredi Bible
-- two alternative-assessment events, between which the reward is divided
-- equally; civics' performance task keeps its pre-reform reward of 0.4
