@ref akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p67 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p68 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p69 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p70 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p71 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p72 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p73 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p74 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p75 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p76 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p77 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p78 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p79 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p80 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p81 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p82 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p83 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p84
`the other compulsory rows` MEANS
    LIST `reward row` "Bible, state"                    2 "" 1.05 (1.4%) 0.45 (0.6%) 1.5 (2%),
         `reward row` "Bible, religious"                3 "" 1.4  (1.4%) 0.6  (0.6%) 2   (2%),
         `reward row` "Oral Torah, religious"           3 "" 1.4  (1.4%) 0.6  (0.6%) 2   (2%),
         `reward row` "Judaism, Haredi"                 3 "" 0.8  (0.8%) 1.2  (1.2%) 2   (2%),
         `reward row` "Bible, Haredi"                   3 "" 0.8  (0.8%) 1.2  (1.2%) 2   (2%),
         `reward row` "Druze culture and heritage / Islam / Christianity" 1 "" 0.7 (1.4%) 0.3 (0.6%) 1 (2%),
         `reward row` "history"                         2 "" 1.05 (1.4%) 0.45 (0.6%) 1.5 (2%),
         `reward row` "civics"                          2 "questionnaire" 1.5 (2%) 0 0 1.5 (2%),
         `reward row` "civics"                          2 "performance task" 0 0 0.4 0 0.4 0,
         `reward row` "literature"                      2 "" 1.05 (1.4%) 0.45 (0.6%) 1.5 (2%),
         `reward row` "literature, religious"           1 "" 0.7  (1.4%) 0.3  (0.6%) 1   (2%),
         `reward row` "Jewish thought, religious"       1 "" 0.7  (1.4%) 0.3  (0.6%) 1   (2%)

-- Where a part has two events, its reward is divided equally between them.
GIVEN `part's reward` IS A NUMBER, events IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the reward per event` `part's reward` events IS
    `part's reward` DIVIDED BY events

-- akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p85 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p86 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p87 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p88 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p89 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p90 The column headings repeated at the top of the next page.

