-- akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p96 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p97 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p98 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p99 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p100 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p101 akn:hc_1__hc_1__para_c/p102 The heading "elective subjects with special instructions" and the table's column headings.

-- The electives with special instructions. The field studies (biotope /
-- bio-research, ecotope, geotope) keep their pre-reform reward, printed in
-- the alternative-hours column with no percent. Chemistry's percentages
